Third-party components shipped with GZH Neo
===========================================

The games load these libraries as DLLs from their folders (Generals\, ZeroHour\). The licence texts are in this
folder; GZH Neo itself is under the GNU GPL v3 with additional terms (LICENSE.md, NOTICE.md one folder up).

FFmpeg - avcodec, avformat, avutil, swresample, swscale (video playback)
  Licence: GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or later (ffmpeg.txt). Built without GPL-only and non-free parts
  and without external libraries.
  Source: @GZH_FFMPEG_SOURCE@
  Built by the vcpkg port "ffmpeg" @GZH_FFMPEG_PORT@ (port files: @GZH_FFMPEG_RECIPE@, the git tree of ports/ffmpeg)
  The corresponding source code is that FFmpeg release with the patches of that vcpkg port; it is offered for download
  in the same place as this setup (ffmpeg-<version>-source.tar.gz, ffmpeg-vcpkg-port-<version>.zip). The DLLs are
  linked dynamically and may be replaced by your own build of the same FFmpeg version.

DirectXTex - texture loading (DirectXTex.dll)
  Licence: MIT (directxtex.txt)

zlib - data compression (z.dll)
  Licence: zlib License (zlib.txt)

DirectX Shader Compiler - shaders of the Vulkan renderer (dxcompiler.dll)
  Licence: University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License (LLVM Release License) and the licences of its parts
  (directx-dxc.txt)

Microsoft Visual C++ runtime - msvcp140*.dll, vcruntime140*.dll, concrt140.dll
  Distributable code of Microsoft Visual Studio, redistributed under its terms.

The setup program is made with Inno Setup (https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php).
